(7322552, 1143198, 177322, '<td valign="top">Certainly an appropriate entry for this challenge - good choice.  The exposure and focus are spot on.  The pyramid, however, for me personally, is an oppressively heavy weight to the bottom of the frame and destroys your composition. Still the colorful and sparkly segments make it interesting to study.</td>', 'Certainly an appropriate entry for this challenge - good choice.  The exposure and focus are spot on.  The pyramid, however, for me personally, is an oppressively heavy weight to the bottom of the frame and destroys your composition. Still the colorful and sparkly segments make it interesting to study.', '2015-03-02 09:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
