(7323489, 1143293, 83149, '<td valign="top">Great idea, funny, and meets the challenge perfectly.  Some things don''t work for me though, and I am having trouble putting my finger on it.  The lighting doesn''t quite work, and neither does the wood grain of the table.  I think the different textures in the table, the colours in the game and the colours and patterns in the hoodie make for too many distractions.  The image is too small as well.<br/> <br/>That being said, it''s the best idea in the challenge.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-03-09 18:26:12.</i></td>', 'Great idea, funny, and meets the challenge perfectly.  Some things don''t work for me though, and I am having trouble putting my finger on it.  The lighting doesn''t quite work, and neither does the wood grain of the table.  I think the different textures in the table, the colours in the game and the colours and patterns in the hoodie make for too many distractions.  The image is too small as well. That being said, it''s the best idea in the challenge.', '2015-03-04 16:50:06.000000', '2015-03-09 18:26:12.000000', 1),
